WEBVTT

00:19:28.454 --> 00:19:33.788
you really have to distinguish the
judgment from decision making.

00:19:34.413 --> 00:19:41.579
And most of the intuitions that we've
studied were fallacies of judgment rather

00:19:41.579 --> 00:19:45.371
than decision making. And second,

00:19:45.746 --> 00:19:50.246
my attitude to intuition is not that
I've spent my life, you know,

00:19:51.038 --> 00:19:55.579
saying that it's not good enough
in the book that we're right

00:19:55.621 --> 00:20:00.163
and just finished writing. Our advice
is not to do without intuition.